  "patterns": [
    {"id":"magic_e","pattern":"a_e / i_e / o_e / u_e","sound":"eɪ / aɪ / oʊ / juː","examples":["sale","size","sole","cute"],"note":"マジック e：語尾の e は読まず、前の母音をアルファベット読みにする。sal → sale。"},
    {"id":"ee_ea","pattern":"ee / ea","sound":"iː","examples":["feet","heel","leave","cheap"],"note":"ea は e の音（bread, head）になる例外もある。"},
    {"id":"oo","pattern":"oo","sound":"uː / ʊ","examples":["shoe→/uː/ food","foot→/ʊ/ good"],"note":"長い oo と短い oo。foot, good, look, book は短い。"},
    {"id":"ar_or_er","pattern":"ar / or / er・ir・ur","sound":"ɑːr / ɔːr / ɜːr","examples":["card","store","work","first","return"],"note":"r 母音。米語では必ず r を響かせる。"},
    {"id":"th","pattern":"th","sound":"θ / ð","examples":["think thanks month","the this they"],"note":"機能語（the, this, that, they）は有声 ð、内容語は無声 θ が多い。"},
    {"id":"ch_sh","pattern":"ch / sh / tch","sound":"tʃ / ʃ","examples":["check","change","shoe","watch"],"note":"ch は「チ」、sh は「シュ」。chef は例外で ʃ。"},
    {"id":"ph_gh","pattern":"ph / gh","sound":"f","examples":["phone","photo","enough","laugh"],"note":"gh は読まないことも多い（light, through）。"},
    {"id":"silent","pattern":"黙字","sound":"—","examples":["receipt (p)","debt (b)","knee (k)","walk (l)","half (l)"],"note":"発音記号を見れば一発で分かる。綴りに引きずられない。"},
    {"id":"ed","pattern":"-ed（過去形）","sound":"t / d / ɪd","examples":["worked /t/","moved /d/","wanted /ɪd/"],"note":"無声音の後は t、有声音の後は d、t/d の後だけ ɪd。"},
    {"id":"s_plural","pattern":"-s / -es","sound":"s / z / ɪz","examples":["books /s/","shoes /z/","sizes /ɪz/"],"note":"無声音の後は s、有声音の後は z、s/z/ʃ/tʃ/dʒ の後は ɪz。"},
    {"id":"stress","pattern":"アクセント（強勢）","sound":"ˈ","examples":["ˈcustomer","inˈventory→ˈinventory","ˈrecord(名) / reˈcord(動)"],"note":"発音記号の ˈ の直後が強い音節。アクセントの位置が違うと通じない。弱い音節は ə になる。"},
    {"id":"linking","pattern":"リンキング（連結）","sound":"—","examples":["check it out → che-ki-taut","an apple → a-napple","what about → wha-da-bout"],"note":"子音＋母音はつなげて読む。t は母音に挟まれると d/ラ行に近くなる（米）。"}
